    "Each place’s next day with at least 80% sunny daylight." : {
      "comment" : "Description below the Saved Places next-sunny-day mode title. The threshold is the share of daylight capsules between sunrise and sunset; in the app, “sunny” includes both clear and partly sunny capsules.",
